Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:09.00,zhu,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}本字幕由豌豆字幕组制作 仅供学习交流 禁止用于商业用途
Comment: 0,0:04:47.02,0:04:47.06,op-jp,,0,0,0,,==========OP==========
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.87,0:04:53.15,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}冷え冷えと蒼褪める夜に僕ら
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.44,0:04:57.74,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}凍えて　灯火探した
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.16,0:05:10.17,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}信じてきたことが全部嘘だとしたら
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.38,0:05:16.24,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}存在意義が揺らぐ　そんな気がしたんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.56,0:05:22.59,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}だけど成したことと成せなかった事実に
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.59,0:05:25.64,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}仄かな動機が宿る
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.64,0:05:28.56,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}それを信じるよ
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.76,0:05:33.23,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}悲劇の始まりだとしても
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.42,0:05:37.65,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}僕は何度でも君を選ぶ
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.33,0:05:45.35,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}疑うことが僕らを引き裂いたから
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.35,0:05:50.04,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}片っぽに互いの約束、結わえて
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.04,0:05:53.12,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}ほどけない手と手、結び目
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.12,0:05:57.60,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}誰かの願いの下に産れたんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.60,0:06:05.39,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}それなら生きとし生けるものに　備わる痛覚が愛って
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.39,0:06:08.33,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}知りながら僕は痛む
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.33,0:06:14.28,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}君の笑みの名残　明日の轍に降り積む
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.87,0:04:53.15,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}在冰冷苍白的黑夜里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.44,0:04:57.74,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}我们瑟瑟发抖 寻找着灯火
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.16,0:05:10.17,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}如果坚信之物全都是谎言
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.38,0:05:16.24,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}那我的存在意义 或将产生动摇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.56,0:05:22.59,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}但在成功与失败之中
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.59,0:05:25.64,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}宿有些微动机
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.64,0:05:28.56,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}我选择相信它
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.76,0:05:33.23,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}即使将开启悲剧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.42,0:05:37.65,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}我也会无数次选择你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.33,0:05:45.35,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}因为怀疑会将我们拆散
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.35,0:05:50.04,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}单方面将二人的约定交缠
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.04,0:05:53.12,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}手与手 线与线 已无法解开
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.12,0:05:57.60,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}我们都是在期望中诞生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.60,0:06:05.39,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}那么 有生之物皆具备的痛觉便是爱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.39,0:06:08.33,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}我虽然知晓 却依然疼痛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.33,0:06:14.28,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}你的笑影纷飞 飘落于明天的车辙
Comment: 0,0:22:04.97,0:22:05.01,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,==========ED==========
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.44,0:22:19.11,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}やっと判りはじめた　気がしているんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.92,0:22:26.45,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}揺れる　螺旋階段　逃げ出すことはできないんだと
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.77,0:22:37.96,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}今はただ　頭ん中　空っぽにして進めばいい
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.17,0:22:47.44,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\3c&HEFA281&}もう認めてしまおう　もうこの弱さも全て
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.44,0:22:54.17,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\3c&HEFA281&}自分自身だろう　そうだろう　向き合うときだろう
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.17,0:23:02.24,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\3c&HBEA35F&}もう受け止めてあげよう　痛みと手を繋ぎ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.24,0:23:04.02,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\3c&HBEA35F&}重なり　交わる
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.02,0:23:09.77,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\3c&HBEA35F&}再編成の意思を　塗り変えよう
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.12,0:23:18.34,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\3c&HB5866B&}もう認めてしまおう　もうこの弱さも全て
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.34,0:23:27.42,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\3c&HB5866B&}自問自答して　見つけた答えに　嘘はないんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.42,0:23:33.75,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\3c&HB7CB86&}きっと　まだ何も始まってないんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.44,0:22:19.11,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}我似乎终于开始明白
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.92,0:22:26.45,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}无法逃离那摇晃的螺旋阶梯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.77,0:22:37.96,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}现在只需要 放空脑袋向前走
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.17,0:22:47.44,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\3c&HEFA281&}就让我承认吧 这份软弱和一切
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.44,0:22:54.17,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\3c&HEFA281&}全都是我自己 没错吧 是时候直面了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.17,0:23:02.24,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\3c&HBEA35F&}就让我接受吧 和痛楚手牵手
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.24,0:23:04.02,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\3c&HBEA35F&}重叠 交织
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.02,0:23:09.77,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\3c&HBEA35F&}将重新编写的想法 全部涂改掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.12,0:23:18.34,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\3c&HB5866B&}就让我承认吧 这份软弱和一切
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.34,0:23:27.42,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\3c&HB5866B&}自问自答找到的答案 绝非虚假
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.42,0:23:33.75,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\3c&HB7CB86&}一定还什么都没有开始
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.02,0:00:05.99,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正细雅宋_GBK\fad(1061,0)\shad3\bord0.1\an3\fs60\pos(1833.34,925.33)}第4集{\fsp3}「撒旦觉醒」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.03,0:01:39.04,zhu,,0,0,0,,证婚人休息室
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.78,0:12:37.78,zhu,,0,0,0,,杀鬼酒馆
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.98,0:23:39.98,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正细雅宋_GBK\shad3\bord0.1\fs50\b1\pos(960,786.18)}下集{\fs30}\N\N{\fs60\fsp3}「比身体更重要的东西」
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.82,0:00:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,头好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.41,0:00:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,宿醉了？你喝太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,那是叫什么派对来着
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.37,0:00:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,单身派对？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.61,0:00:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,利克使劲给我灌酒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.79,0:00:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,而且他不管怎么喝都喝不醉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.50,0:00:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我无奈之下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.18,0:00:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,就把除他之外的人全灌醉了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.22,0:00:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你搞什么啊 要是毁了婚礼怎么办啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.85,0:00:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,利克只有喝酒厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.48,0:00:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,和他喝酒还不赖
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.98,0:00:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的 你这领带怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.84,0:00:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,就不能系好一点吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.44,0:00:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,只在这种时候系好一点也没用啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.16,0:01:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你是不知道怎么系吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.54,0:01:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你重新系
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.82,0:01:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.89,0:01:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,把领子立起来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.32,0:01:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你这小鬼还挺熟练啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.20,0:01:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,小鬼？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.36,0:01:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,就是小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.94,0:01:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,明明是大人 却连领带都不会系
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.97,0:01:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,会系领带就是大人了？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.64,0:01:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不会系领带但是会耍嘴皮子就是大人了？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.84,0:01:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你好烦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.09,0:01:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好 系好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.56,0:01:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧 婚礼要开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.02,0:01:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,利克 恭喜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.60,0:01:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,小卷
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.31,0:02:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我们真的成为大人了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.02,0:02:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.42,0:02:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,大人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.02,0:03:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是想要吗 给你了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.41,0:03:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.70,0:03:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,要拍了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.29,0:03:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,真是场不错的婚礼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.90,0:03:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你都说多少次了 喝醉了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.30,0:03:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这可是利克的婚礼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.00,0:03:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,自己争取到了幸福 真厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.74,0:03:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 不只是利克
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.24,0:03:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我开始编写教材
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.14,0:03:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你一边执行任务 一边在驱魔塾教书
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.33,0:03:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然态度冷淡 但学生都很崇拜你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.90,0:03:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,态度冷淡是多余的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.57,0:03:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,那个时候 我根本想不到会有现在
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.94,0:04:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,大家真的…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.78,0:04:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,都是我的宝物
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.15,0:04:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你确实是大人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.40,0:04:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,什么什么？你小声说了重要的话吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.17,0:04:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你说了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.18,0:04:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,烦死了 没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.55,0:04:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.19,0:06:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,路西法
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.59,0:06:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这座设施和研究 都快坚持不下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.62,0:06:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,请你舍弃对物质的执着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.87,0:06:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.42,0:06:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,想要构建一个充满温柔光芒的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.09,0:06:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,一个人人平等的公平世界
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.53,0:07:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托你了 谢米哈萨
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.10,0:07:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要身体…需要能动的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.52,0:07:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,也给我…希望之光吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.22,0:07:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不 路西法
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.42,0:07:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不可以改变世界的法则
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.54,0:07:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你这样也算人类吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.21,0:07:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,在我就任这个职位时 就已经舍弃了人情
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.70,0:07:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.24,0:07:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,阿玛依蒙好像找到了新的依附体
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.09,0:07:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,下一个…下一个一定会…轮到我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.64,0:07:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,否则就太不合理了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.02,0:08:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,是那个实验体
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.52,0:08:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,阿撒泻勒So-005
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.80,0:08:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,有恶魔依附进去了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.14,0:08:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不是我…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.69,0:08:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么把我叫回来了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.65,0:08:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,为了保密
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.72,0:08:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,而且也缺人手
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.62,0:08:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,总之你先看看
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.48,0:08:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,咬郎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.08,0:08:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,让他冷静 注射镇定剂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.20,0:09:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,快退后
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.07,0:09:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不好 要逃了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.41,0:09:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.84,0:09:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,那是个什么恶魔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.35,0:09:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,累了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.93,0:09:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,尤莉 去喝一杯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.87,0:09:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,狮郎说今天来不了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.42,0:09:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我也得在明天前出好试卷
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.40,0:09:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我答应了他的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.85,0:09:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,真是会使唤你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.41,0:09:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,别什么都答应 这是坏习惯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.52,0:09:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.96,0:10:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.67,0:10:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,燐火？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.74,0:10:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,狮郎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.50,0:10:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不是他
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.72,0:10:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,别过来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.27,0:10:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.94,0:10:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,尤…莉…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.54,0:10:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,燐火？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.12,0:10:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.70,0:10:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.36,0:10:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,尤…莉…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.96,0:10:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.08,0:11:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,带回去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.22,0:11:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你是驱魔师吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.45,0:11:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.36,0:11:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 跟我们走一趟吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.97,0:11:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他为什么会去找这名女子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.50,0:11:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正在审讯她
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.73,0:11:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,她也有可能是碰巧被卷进来的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.24,0:11:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,尤…莉…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.59,0:11:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.68,0:11:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.49,0:11:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他不会又…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.01,0:11:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,尤…莉…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.63,0:11:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,开枪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.53,0:11:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,快住手
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.37,0:12:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,尤莉…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.74,0:12:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不可以
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.62,0:12:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,乖孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.40,0:12:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,听话了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.76,0:12:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.58,0:12:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,看来很喜欢她啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.30,0:12:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,听说她是很优秀的手骑士啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.04,0:12:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,请她协助怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.80,0:12:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不先把他驯服 就一切无从谈起
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.16,0:12:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我要兼任第13部门的工作了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.08,0:12:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.38,0:12:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的是个傻子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.72,0:12:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你也要在第13部门工作吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.29,0:12:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我原本就跟那里有渊源
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.86,0:12:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,第13部门的事 我已经接受过培训了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.26,0:13:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是在那里出生的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.32,0:13:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么要掺和进来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.28,0:13:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是因为渊源
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.41,0:13:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那孩子是我儿时的玩伴
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.39,0:13:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 你真漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.53,0:13:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,没想到他会依附在人身上出现
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.82,0:13:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,没想到他会是这么高级的恶魔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.72,0:13:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他已经杀了好几个人 却没有自知
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.78,0:13:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,是个拥有强大力量的婴儿
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.52,0:13:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能不管
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.88,0:13:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,就因为你会这样跟恶魔扯上关系
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.30,0:13:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,才会越陷越深
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.86,0:13:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,真的会死的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.54,0:13:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,有事找我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.36,0:13:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我走了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.15,0:13:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,尤莉？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.60,0:13:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,喂喂喂 怎么了 吵架了？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.06,0:13:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,利克 怎么这就醉了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.40,0:14:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你在搞什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.25,0:14:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.67,0:14:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你明明很喜欢她
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.83,0:14:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,别看尤莉那样 其实很受欢迎的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.05,0:14:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,她要是被别人抢走了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.98,0:14:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不管啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.84,0:14:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,兄长
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.75,0:14:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你认为那个新来的是什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.78,0:14:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,他连通着世间一切事物
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.17,0:14:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该也感觉到了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.91,0:14:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那是孕育了我们的…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.51,0:14:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,森罗万象本身
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.55,0:14:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我开动了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.20,0:14:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我开动了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.42,0:14:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.99,0:15:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,快擦擦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.45,0:15:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.70,0:15:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,苹果
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.67,0:15:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,答对了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.78,0:15:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,那这个呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.94,0:15:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,企鹅
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.06,0:15:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,答对了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.72,0:15:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,47加32等于？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.76,0:15:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,79
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.15,0:15:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,549加64等于？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.65,0:15:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,613
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.50,0:15:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,46乘9
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.34,0:15:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,414
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.05,0:15:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,523除以6
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.81,0:15:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,87.16666…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.89,0:15:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,好无聊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.00,0:15:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,出点更难的题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.78,0:15:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害 转眼就吸收了知识
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.80,0:15:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这个也腻了 虽然很喜欢吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.31,0:15:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.33,0:15:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么要做这么残忍的事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.46,0:15:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,只是试了一下能不能开孔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.48,0:16:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,一直跟我待在一起啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.92,0:16:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我不要
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.12,0:16:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,理性和情感无法短时间培养出来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.45,0:16:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,能一个人看家可是很帅的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.18,0:16:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我肯定会称赞你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.67,0:16:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,尤莉 你会高兴？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.75,0:16:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.34,0:16:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,一定要回来啊 不然我不会原谅你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.28,0:16:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,一年三个月过去了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.26,0:16:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他的不平衡越来越显得危险
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.85,0:16:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,提高教育水平吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.08,0:16:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫人送新教材和书本过来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.86,0:16:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.19,0:16:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不增长经验而只给他大量知识很危险
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.83,0:16:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,必须拓宽他的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.18,0:16:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,能不能让我之外的人 也和他接触呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.93,0:16:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这才更危险吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.62,0:16:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他去年杀死了那么多职员
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.31,0:17:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不认为有人愿意和他接触
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.75,0:17:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,也对…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.04,0:17:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是觉得这样比站在外面看着更有意义
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.84,0:17:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.46,0:17:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.15,0:17:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你别误会
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.96,0:17:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,要是出了意外 我就杀死他
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.72,0:17:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,燐火 今天有外面的人来玩了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.84,0:17:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他叫狮郎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.60,0:17:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不许靠近尤莉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.02,0:17:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么了 狮郎什么也不会做哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.28,0:17:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 我不知道为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.20,0:17:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 我讨厌你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.23,0:17:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.65,0:17:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那我就一个人玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.16,0:18:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这个好怀念啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.58,0:18:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我的 不许碰
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.62,0:18:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,玩一下下又没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.94,0:18:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这个很难 你肯定玩不好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.31,0:18:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你看着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.96,0:18:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,很简单
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.10,0:18:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我也来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.41,0:18:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,没进
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.64,0:18:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,要这样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.24,0:18:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我也要玩
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.69,0:18:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,菜鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.27,0:18:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,狮郎 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.72,0:18:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,燐火 不可以向别人撒气
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.56,0:18:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.17,0:18:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,输了很不甘心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.88,0:18:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你想怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.88,0:18:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我想赢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.09,0:18:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我想赢过他
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.44,0:18:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那就练习吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.79,0:18:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,变得比狮郎厉害就行了呀
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.28,0:19:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,唉 块头跟我一样大却哭哭啼啼的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.76,0:19:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我不喜欢小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.16,0:19:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你不也是 像个小孩一样挑衅他
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.44,0:19:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经决定不会输给恶魔了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.24,0:19:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.46,0:19:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你要这么说 那我就不来了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.81,0:19:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊 来陪陪他
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.81,0:19:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,今天燐火一定也学到了东西
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.09,0:19:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,真没办法 算你欠我个人情啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.11,0:19:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.40,0:19:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 燐火 把玩具收起来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.49,0:19:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,赢过他 赢过他 赢过他…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.99,0:19:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,下次我绝对要赢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.18,0:19:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.04,0:19:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,明天见
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.45,0:20:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我说 艾金很可爱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.62,0:20:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是在跟藤本狮郎交往啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.90,0:20:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.67,0:20:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.92,0:20:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,紧急情况 005破坏了大门
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.96,0:20:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,出什么事了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.38,0:20:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,艾金 对不起 是我批准的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.34,0:20:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,他以看守为人质 要我们给他书
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.79,0:20:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,要我们在你来之前 尽可能给他情报
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.84,0:20:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.62,0:20:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然我一开始很担心 但目前他还没杀人质
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.67,0:20:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我去和他谈 要他放了人质
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.02,0:21:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,燐火
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.80,0:21:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,燐火？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.78,0:21:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好怀念的名字啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.17,0:21:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,放了这个人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.06,0:21:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这人已经没用了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.30,0:21:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了 来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.85,0:21:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你吓了一跳吗 尤莉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.49,0:21:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,真有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.57,0:21:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经和昨天不一样了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.42,0:21:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,获得了这里的所有知识 我终于确信了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.95,0:21:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我这一存在就相当于神
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.39,0:21:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不 应该是魔神
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.06,0:21:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,今后你们要叫我…
